flowchart TD
  Need[Need detected] --> Reuse{Existing agent can handle?}
  Reuse -- Yes --> Assign[Assign existing agent]
  Reuse -- No --> Blueprint[Create agent blueprint]
  Blueprint --> Gov[Governance review]
  Gov --> Test[Test task]
  Test --> Passed{Passed?}
  Passed -- No --> Improve[Improve blueprint]
  Improve --> Gov
  Passed -- Yes --> Active[Activate agent]
  Active --> Review[Performance review]
  Review --> Keep{Still useful?}
  Keep -- Yes --> Optimize[Optimize agent]
  Optimize --> Active
  Keep -- No --> Retire[Retire agent]
